      "spam": false,
      "value": "To have more control over who should get into your world, you should make an invite-only or invite+ instance.\n\nFriends of guest worlds are practically a \"public lite\" instance, so banning people from one shouldn't be a thing I think.\nCircumventing the kick obviously sucks, but if that becomes a problem then I think creating a more private instance and going there instead should be the solution.\n\nWhat should be done is making sure the kick actually works.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
