      "value": "@{5ac75f02eae97a2368734284|full_name}: The kick is supposed to lock you out temporarily from rejoining the instance, but since that is being bypassed I think fixing the kick should be made instead of adding a \"ban\" feature.\n\nWhat if you ban me, couple of days later you create an friends+ instance and we have a friend in common who is in there. I decided to join on him but I'm banned from joining.\n\nI don't think users should be able to deny others access to joining friends+ worlds, only be able to kick them if they cause trouble.",
      "viewerReactions": null
