      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: well I can see where he's going with this. Some people like to make public worlds to meet new people. But when you are meeting new people in a lobby you created orbs friend of yours created and a troll and friends join,  you should be allowed to do such a thing so the troll doesn't fuck the world up for you and your new found friends",
