  "details": "Hello everyone, yesterday I came across a interesting bug. I made my looby \"friends of guests\" to play mafia game, and the person come in which is blocked. I Tried to kick him, but he bypassing it with strange method like (Killing vrchat.exe procces in task manager while I'm kicking him). After all this manipulations, when he reconnecting I'm getting off from my own room. I already sent a video with this thing, so I'm suggesting to add \"ban\" button. \"How it will work?\" For example you have banned somebody, this person will not be able to connect to your own lobby anymore. You can ban him permanently or temporarily and is necessary to make below from ban button a ban list. Trolls can spoil your day and this system will the best thing to avoid them in vrchat. What do you think about this folks?",
